{"type":"text","timestamp":1789824728462,"sessionID":"ses_f462b3faeffehKvke01c5BeJ5s","part":{"id":"prt_0b9ddf495001JVyniHcPKN1xJ5","sessionID":"ses_f462b3faeffehKvke01c5BeJ5s","messageID":"msg_0b9dbb06a001wmbjsOII4Uj2I6","type":"text","text":"I've completed my analysis pass. Before building, here is the proposed structure (as the instruction requires):\n\n**Proposed process/round map (single process, 2013 sale of Mac-Gray):**\n- **Round 0** (pre-opening): Party A contact 04/08/2013 and its unsolicited 06/21/2013 $17–$19 cash proposal; prior adviser history.\n- **Round 1** opens **06/24/2013** — Special Committee's decision to consider a sale and solicit 50 parties (outreach executed within days; first outreach-wave date itself not disclosed; rejected anchor candidates = 06/21 proposal, 06/28 first NDA). Preliminary IOIs due 07/23/2013 (CSC/Pamplona on time; Party B and Party C after the date, considered 07/25 → *Late bids accepted*).\n- **Round 2** opens **07/25/2013** — selection of the four bidders for staged access/management presentations and revised IOIs (alternative anchor: 08/27 letter, due 09/09/2013; Party A and Party C submitted 09/10 → *Late bids accepted*).\n- **Round 3** opens **09/11/2013** — first request for **final indications of interest** (due 09/18/2013; *Announced as final*; due date *Enforced*; Party C did not submit).\n- **Round 4** opens **09/24/2013** — executed exclusivity with CSC/Pamplona and definitive-agreement negotiation (*Inferred final*); alternative treatment = fold into Round 3 (will be raised in Questions).\n- **Post-signing:** signing 10/14/2013, announcement 10/15/2013; no competing proposal/go-shop disclosed; HSR expiry and litigation to Summary only.\n\nNow let me pull the full text of the longer background paragraphs so my quotations are exact, then build the workbook.","time":{"start":1789824726165,"end":1789824728462}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1789824728493,"sessionID":"ses_f462b3faeffehKvke01c5BeJ5s","part":{"partID":"prt_0b9ddfb8d0019Ref46uJHn0JFw","sessionID":"ses_f462b3faeffehKvke01c5BeJ5s","messageID":"msg_0b9dbb06a001wmbjsOII4Uj2I6","type":"tool","id":"call_00_t6DCDykre8UsocuWOZYQ8419","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /tmp/opencode && python3 - <<'EOF'\nimport json\nblocks = json.load(open('blocks2.json'))\nids = [648,651,652,653,656,657,670,671,674,681,692,695,698,699,702,703,712,718,720,725,726,734]\nwith open('/tmp/opencode/longblocks.txt','w') as f:\n    for i in ids:\n        k,t,p = blocks[i]\n        f.write(f\"===== {i} (p.{p}) =====\\n{t}\\n\\n\")\nprint('ok')\nEOF\nwc -c /tmp/opencode/longblocks.txt"},"output":"ok\n33631 /tmp/opencode/longblocks.txt\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"ok\n33631 /tmp/opencode/longblocks.txt\n"},{"type":"text","text":"Command exited with code 0."}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\": \"cd /tmp/opencode && python3 - <<'EOF'\\nimport json\\nblocks = json.load(open('blocks2.json'))\\nids = [648,651,652,653,656,657,670,671,674,681,692,695,698,699,702,703,712,718,720,725,726,734]\\nwith open('/tmp/opencode/longblocks.txt','w') as f:\\n    for i in ids:\\n        k,t,p = blocks[i]\\n        f.write(f\\\"===== {i} (p.{p}) =====\\\\n{t}\\\\n\\\\n\\\")\\nprint('ok')\\nEOF\\nwc -c /tmp/opencode/longblocks.txt\"}"},"time":{"start":1789824727949,"end":1789824728493}}}}
