{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1789825164466,"sessionID":"ses_f462b3faeffehKvke01c5BeJ5s","part":{"partID":"prt_0b9e49fc2001lQjqPWXP8bJkmh","sessionID":"ses_f462b3faeffehKvke01c5BeJ5s","messageID":"msg_0b9e4984d0012kgzbE62dNtKza","type":"tool","id":"call_00_ET_J1vaNgzILOleyBieqFBo1511","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"newString":"s_pair(\"Advisers\", \"BofA Merrill Lynch (Merrill Lynch, Pierce, Fenner & Smith Incorporated) - Mac-Gray's financial advisor: 2011-2012 Discussions engagement 10/23/2012 (R001), terminated 05/15/2013 (R005), re-engaged for the sale process by Board approval 05/30/2013 with engagement letter 05/31/2013 (R006); delivered the fairness opinion dated 10/14/2013 [X-027]. Goodwin Procter LLP - outside legal counsel to Mac-Gray (observed acting from 05/09/2013, R004; drafted the merger agreement and advised the Special Committee throughout). Kirkland & Ellis LLP - outside legal counsel to CSC/Pamplona from 09/25/2013 (R042 note). Clients are as stated by the filing; no unclear client affiliations identified.\")","oldString":"s_pair(\"Advisers\", \"BofA Merrill Lynch (Merrill Lynch, Pierce, Fenner & Smith Incorporated) - Mac-Gray's financial advisor: 2011-2012 Discussions engagement 10/23/2012 (R001), terminated 05/15/2013 (R005), re-engaged for the sale process by Board approval 05/30/2013 with engagement letter 05/31/2013 (R006); delivered the fairness opinion dated 10/14/2013 [X-026]. Goodwin Procter LLP - outside legal counsel to Mac-Gray (observed acting from 05/09/2013, R004; drafted the merger agreement and advised the Special Committee throughout). Kirkland & Ellis LLP - outside legal counsel to CSC/Pamplona from 09/25/2013 (R042 note). Clients are as stated by the filing; no unclear client affiliations identified.\")","path":"/tmp/opencode/make_workbook.py"},"output":"Edited /tmp/opencode/make_workbook.py (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":"/tmp/opencode/make_workbook.py","patch":"Index: /tmp/opencode/make_workbook.py\n===================================================================\n--- /tmp/opencode/make_workbook.py\n+++ /tmp/opencode/make_workbook.py\n@@ -300,9 +300,9 @@\n s_pair(\"CSC/Pamplona (strategic; winner)\", \"First observed contact 06/28/2013 (R011); NDA 07/11/2013 (R015); bids 07/23 $18.50, 09/09 $19.50, 09/18 $20.75 and 09/21 $21.25 last and best (R018, R028, R035, R040); exclusivity 09/24/2013 (R041); signing 10/14/2013 (R048). No exit row (winner). Unit composition: CSC ServiceWorks, Inc. (operating acquirer) and Pamplona (equity capital commitment); Pamplona's funding is support, not a membership change or joint-bidder formation.\")\n s_pair(\"16 residual NDA signers (financial)\", \"Entered as residual cohort of 20 signers less the four recorded individually (R016; count 16); closed Did not submit by 07/23/2013 (R019; inferred residual; base assumes all 20 were eligible - flagged Q3).\")\n s_pair(\"Moab Partners, L.P. (shareholder, approximately 9%)\", \"Not a bidder. Proxy contest and two directors elected 05/30/2013 (R007); rollover request denied 07/06/2013 (R014) and resolved without a rollover by 10/07/2013 (R046); voting agreement at signing (R048).\")\n s_pair(\"Stewart G. MacDonald, Jr. (CEO; significant holder)\", \"Not a bidder. Excluded from sale-process evaluation 06/24/2013 (R009); declined a share rollover 09/11/2013 and wanted a higher value (R032); supportive of $21.25 (R039); voting agreement effective at signing (R048).\")\n-s_pair(\"Advisers\", \"BofA Merrill Lynch (Merrill Lynch, Pierce, Fenner & Smith Incorporated) - Mac-Gray's financial advisor: 2011-2012 Discussions engagement 10/23/2012 (R001), terminated 05/15/2013 (R005), re-engaged for the sale process by Board approval 05/30/2013 with engagement letter 05/31/2013 (R006); delivered the fairness opinion dated 10/14/2013 [X-026]. Goodwin Procter LLP - outside legal counsel to Mac-Gray (observed acting from 05/09/2013, R004; drafted the merger agreement and advised the Special Committee throughout). Kirkland & Ellis LLP - outside legal counsel to CSC/Pamplona from 09/25/2013 (R042 note). Clients are as stated by the filing; no unclear client affiliations identified.\")\n+s_pair(\"Advisers\", \"BofA Merrill Lynch (Merrill Lynch, Pierce, Fenner & Smith Incorporated) - Mac-Gray's financial advisor: 2011-2012 Discussions engagement 10/23/2012 (R001), terminated 05/15/2013 (R005), re-engaged for the sale process by Board approval 05/30/2013 with engagement letter 05/31/2013 (R006); delivered the fairness opinion dated 10/14/2013 [X-027]. Goodwin Procter LLP - outside legal counsel to Mac-Gray (observed acting from 05/09/2013, R004; drafted the merger agreement and advised the Special Committee throughout). Kirkland & Ellis LLP - outside legal counsel to CSC/Pamplona from 09/25/2013 (R042 note). Clients are as stated by the filing; no unclear client affiliations identified.\")\n s_head(\"5. Counts and auction screen\")\n s_formula(\"NDA signers (ledger)\",\n           \"=SUMIFS('Deal ledger'!$Q:$Q,'Deal ledger'!$P:$P,\\\"Yes\\\",'Deal ledger'!$D:$D,\\\"NDA signed\\\")\",\n           \"Filing assertion: 20 (two strategic bidders - Party A and CSC/Pamplona - and 18 financial bidders, including Party B and Party C) [P-034]. Ledger = 4 individually recorded signers + 16 residual cohort = 20; reconciles exactly. Residual dates and eligibility are uncertain (Q3).\")\n","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":1}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited /tmp/opencode/make_workbook.py (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\": \"s_pair(\\\"Advisers\\\", \\\"BofA Merrill Lynch (Merrill Lynch, Pierce, Fenner & Smith Incorporated) - Mac-Gray's financial advisor: 2011-2012 Discussions engagement 10/23/2012 (R001), terminated 05/15/2013 (R005), re-engaged for the sale process by Board approval 05/30/2013 with engagement letter 05/31/2013 (R006); delivered the fairness opinion dated 10/14/2013 [X-027]. Goodwin Procter LLP - outside legal counsel to Mac-Gray (observed acting from 05/09/2013, R004; drafted the merger agreement and advised the Special Committee throughout). Kirkland & Ellis LLP - outside legal counsel to CSC/Pamplona from 09/25/2013 (R042 note). Clients are as stated by the filing; no unclear client affiliations identified.\\\")\", \"oldString\": \"s_pair(\\\"Advisers\\\", \\\"BofA Merrill Lynch (Merrill Lynch, Pierce, Fenner & Smith Incorporated) - Mac-Gray's financial advisor: 2011-2012 Discussions engagement 10/23/2012 (R001), terminated 05/15/2013 (R005), re-engaged for the sale process by Board approval 05/30/2013 with engagement letter 05/31/2013 (R006); delivered the fairness opinion dated 10/14/2013 [X-026]. Goodwin Procter LLP - outside legal counsel to Mac-Gray (observed acting from 05/09/2013, R004; drafted the merger agreement and advised the Special Committee throughout). Kirkland & Ellis LLP - outside legal counsel to CSC/Pamplona from 09/25/2013 (R042 note). Clients are as stated by the filing; no unclear client affiliations identified.\\\")\", \"path\": \"/tmp/opencode/make_workbook.py\"}"},"time":{"start":1789825163202,"end":1789825164466}}}}
