gic bidders (Party A and CSC/Pamplona) and 18 financial bidders'). Accounting at the first transition: P-037 names only Party B, Party C, CSC/Pamplona and Party A's standing proposal. Arithmetic: 20 - 4 = 16. Uncertainty: the 16 signers' dates are unstated and signers whose NDAs postdate 07/23 would reduce the residual; Party A signed only on 08/05 but is shown continuing, so it is not in the residual.\\\",\", \"oldString\": \"  \\\"Base and split: P-034 ('a total of 20 potential bidders, including two strategic bidders (Party A and CSC/Pamplona) and 18 financial bidders'). Accounting at the first transition: P-045 names only Party B, Party C, CSC/Pamplona and Party A's standing proposal. Arithmetic: 20 - 4 = 16. Uncertainty: the 16 signers' dates are unstated and signers whose NDAs postdate 07/23 would reduce the residual; Party A signed only on 08/05 but is shown continuing, so it is not in the residual.\\\",\", \"path\": \"/tmp/opencode/make_workbook.py\"}"},"time":{"start":1789825174524,"end":1789825175441}}}}
