sis to a genuine final, binding or best-and-final solicitation'; a non-binding IOI can be Formal; no retrospective upgrading of earlier offers. Sources: P-064 (09/18 responses), P-055 (final request), P-067 (09/21 confirmation). Party A's call is the borderline case and is flagged here rather than upgraded silently.\\\",\", \"path\": \"/tmp/opencode/make_workbook.py\"}"},"time":{"start":1789825181351,"end":1789825181968}}}}
