mplona's 09/09 and later bids (R028, R035, R040 - committed sponsor financing, no stated diligence condition). Keep Insufficient evidence for Party C's 09/10/2013 revised indication (R031 - price only, financing silence).\",\n-  \"Heavy-by-context applies to preliminary indications made before data-room or management access; 'less conditional' comparisons were not converted into absolute levels; silence neither raises nor lowers a level. Sources: P-034, P-043 to P-045 (pre-DD IOIs), P-054 (CSC/Pamplona committed funding; Party B no firm commitment), P-055 (Party C silence), P-040 (access staging).\",\n+  \"Heavy-by-context applies to preliminary indications made before data-room or management access; 'less conditional' comparisons were not converted into absolute levels; silence neither raises nor lowers a level. Sources: P-026, P-035 to P-037 (pre-DD IOIs), P-052 (CSC/Pamplona committed funding; Party B no firm commitment), P-053 (Party C silence), P-047 (access staging).\",\n   \"R008, R018, R020, R021, R023, R028-R031, R035-R037, R040; Conditions level and Conditions detail fields\",\n   \"Reassigning a level changes the comparable conditionality of final offers and the four documented Heavy-by-context calls at the first stage.\",\n   \"Pending\", None),\n  (\"Q7\", \"Price representation for Party B's cash-plus-options package and related conventions\",\n","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":1}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited /tmp/opencode/make_workbook.py (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\": \"  \\\"Heavy-by-context applies to preliminary indications made before data-room or management access; 'less conditional' comparisons were not converted into absolute levels; silence neither raises nor lowers a level. Sources: P-026, P-035 to P-037 (pre-DD IOIs), P-052 (CSC/Pamplona committed funding; Party B no firm commitment), P-053 (Party C silence), P-047 (access staging).\\\",\", \"oldString\": \"  \\\"Heavy-by-context applies to preliminary indications made before data-room or management access; 'less conditional' comparisons were not converted into absolute levels; silence neither raises nor lowers a level. Sources: P-034, P-043 to P-045 (pre-DD IOIs), P-054 (CSC/Pamplona committed funding; Party B no firm commitment), P-055 (Party C silence), P-040 (access staging).\\\",\", \"path\": \"/tmp/opencode/make_workbook.py\"}"},"time":{"start":1789825184144,"end":1789825184778}}}}
