rvice, and no rows for termination/reverse fees, liability caps, voting agreements, post-signing covenants or successive drafts (folded into R040, R041, R047, R048).\nWHY: All are instruction conventions (sections 5.4, 8.1, 10.2) or explicit materiality exclusions (section 4); quotations on the Source text sheet preserve wording and qualification, and no working date falls outside its Date from/Date to or contradicts the filing's before/after bounds.\nAFFECTED: R001, R005, R006, R010, R014, R016, R019, R024, R032, R038, R043, R044, R046, R047, R048; Date from/to, Working date, Date basis, Date method, Page fields\nCONSEQUENCE: Changing conventions reorders display or shifts assigned dates but not the underlying facts; moving the typo correction or rollover rows would affect only those rows' framing.\nSTATUS: Pending\n\n"},{"type":"text","text":"Command exited with code 0."}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\": \"cd /tmp/opencode && python3 - <<'EOF' > /tmp/opencode/questions_dump.txt\\nfrom openpyxl import load_workbook\\nwb = load_workbook('/home/uctpiaj/work/extraction/mac-gray.xlsx')\\nq = wb['Questions']\\nfor r in range(2, q.max_row+1):\\n    print(f\\\"===== {q.cell(row=r,column=1).value} | {q.cell(row=r,column=2).value} =====\\\")\\n    print(\\\"RECOMMENDED:\\\", q.cell(row=r,column=3).value)\\n    print(\\\"WHY:\\\", q.cell(row=r,column=4).value)\\n    print(\\\"AFFECTED:\\\", q.cell(row=r,column=5).value)\\n    print(\\\"CONSEQUENCE:\\\", q.cell(row=r,column=6).value)\\n    print(\\\"STATUS:\\\", q.cell(row=r,column=7).value)\\n    print()\\nEOF\\nhead -60 /tmp/opencode/questions_dump.txt\"}"},"time":{"start":1789825261816,"end":1789825262684}}}}
